5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We must look at what actually survived the first year, not just the launch.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about where the money comes from next year.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know if the groundwork was checked before we promised dates.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the daily losses versus the effort spent.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who is actually doing the extra work? The rota is silent.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, the renewal notice is a real trap. I agree.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, yes. The budget line is frozen, but the bill arrives later.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji, daily losses are invisible until they pile up. I see that.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, exactly. We judge by sound, not by the floor reality.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, if the money is frozen, we are borrowing from future staff time.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
