17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will check the network coverage at customer plants.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will look at the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
