35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The reviews show tools needing daily entry from everyone were quietly dropped.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance has room after cancellations.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Half the customer plants lose signal for whole afternoons. That is a major risk.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,We lose an hour daily just copying details that are already written down.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The same two people write every progress note by hand. They are stretched thin.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, that copying time is exactly the kind of waste we should fix.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, so we should avoid anything requiring heavy daily manual input?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, if the coordination group is that thin, any new tool needs them.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, yes. The narrow tools for one trade still run. The broad ones fail.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Sakura, correct. We cannot add more manual work to those two people.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,The standardization efforts mostly ended without an owner. That is a warning.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The vendor licences climb with every department added. Fixed-fee work is stable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,The in-house developers are committed to the accounting upgrade until Q3.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The misrouted deliveries were traced to duplicate addresses, not inexperience.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The clerks request the same certificate from the same firm repeatedly.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
